# Focused entry for a failed element read on a null binding.
# Run from the repository root; the caller supplies the output path so
# every attempt writes into its own run directory:
#   nix develop -c haxe tests/haxe/place-contract/readfault.hxml \
#     -js out/place-contract/runs/<run>/readfault.js
-cp tests/haxe/place-contract
-cp samples
-main place.PlaceReadFault
